cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, cite its versioned GitHub/Zenodo release."
title: "NS25Lean: Sharp Type Bounds and Finite Equality Classification for Four-Generated Numerical Semigroups"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sato
    given-names: Keisuke
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/stksk310/NS-P25-Lean"
url: "https://github.com/stksk310/NS-P25-Lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of sharp type bounds for minimally four-generated numerical
  semigroups, including P2/P3 strong bounds and a noncircular finite intrinsic
  equality classification with finite ALL-PIVOTS. The historical geometric
  NEIT/NEIT* and six-case PCR classification is not part of this verified scope.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - numerical semigroup
  - formal verification
  - type bound
  - equality classification
